### TaskFlow API - Manual Testing Requests (REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@email = alice@example.com
@password = StrongPassword123!

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Prometheus Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### 3. User Registration (Signup)
# @name signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "full_name": "Alice Wonderland"
}

### 4. User Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Store Auth Token from response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 5. Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Create Project
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "E-Commerce Core API",
  "description": "Payment gateway and checkout workflow engine"
}

### Store Project ID
@projectId = {{createProject.response.body.id}}

### 7. List User Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Create Task in Project
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implement Stripe Webhook Handlers",
  "description": "Handle payment succeeded and refund webhook events",
  "status": "todo",
  "due_date": "2026-08-31T18:00:00Z"
}

### Store Task ID
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.id}}

### 9. Filter & Search Tasks (Cache-Backed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?status=todo&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Update Task Status (Triggers Instant Cache Invalidation)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 11. List Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Delete Task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

